<title>USA: Carson Pirie Scott Jan same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Carson Pirie Scott Jan same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$53.8	$48.2     +11.6	 +5.6</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $1,102.8   $1,044.8	+5.6	 +2.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is	4 weeks ended	   Feb 1.</p>
<p>    Full company name is	  Carson Pirie Scott &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 year to date sales exclude $25.0 million of sales from eight stores that were sold in March 1995 and $14.0 million of sales during the 53rd week.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
